      "string_id": "escape_trader_actor_set_zombied_5",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Now I've just about seen everything. Look, head to the eggheads at Yantar. Find Sakharov. He may be of help to you. You hear me? YANTAR! SAKHAROV! HELP YOU!! Now, get out of here before someone drops you... OUTSIDE, GO!",
      "JA_current": "Now I've just about seen everything. Look, head to the eggheads at Yantar. Find Sakharov. He may be of help to you. You hear me? YANTAR! SAKHAROV! HELP YOU!! Now, get out of here before someone drops you... OUTSIDE, GO!",
      "JA_new": "もう驚くこともないと思ってたがな。いいか、ヤンターの研究者のところへ行け。サハロフを訪ねろ。助けになってくれるかもしれん。聞こえたか？ ヤンターだ！ サハロフがお前を助ける！ さあ、誰かに撃たれる前に出ていけ……外だ、行け！",
